@ref 1 U.S.C. s 112b(a)(1)(B)(ii) (src:135)
GIVEN `it is listed under clause (i) of subparagraph (B)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `its text differs from the text previously provided under subparagraph (A)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 112b(a)(1)(B)(ii) requires the text to be provided again` `it is listed under clause (i) of subparagraph (B)` `its text differs from the text previously provided under subparagraph (A)(ii)` MEANS
        `it is listed under clause (i) of subparagraph (B)`
    AND `its text differs from the text previously provided under subparagraph (A)(ii)`

-- src:137 | (2) The information and text required by paragraph (1) shall be submitted in unclassified form, but may include a classified annex.
