    `the information and text submitted are in unclassified form`

§§ `Section 112b(b) - posting on the website of the Department of State`

-- src:139 | Not later than 120 days after the date on which an international agreement enters into force, the Secretary shall make the text of the agreement, and the information described in subparagraphs (A)(iii) and (B)(iii) of subsection (a)(1) relating to the agreement, available to the public on the website of the Department of State.
@ref 1 U.S.C. s 112b(b)(1) (src:139)
GIVEN `the day the international agreement enters into force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the latest day to post the text of an international agreement under section 112b(b)(1)` `the day the international agreement enters into force` MEANS
    `the day that is a number of days after a date` 120 `the day the international agreement enters into force`

-- src:140 | Not less frequently than once every 120 days, the Secretary shall make the text of each qualifying non-binding instrument that became operative during the preceding 120 days, and the information described in subparagraphs (A)(iii) and (B)(iii) of subsection (a)(1) relating to each such instrument, available to the public on the website of the Department of State.
@ref 1 U.S.C. s 112b(b)(2) (src:140)
GIVEN `the day of the last posting` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the latest day for the next posting of qualifying non-binding instruments under section 112b(b)(2)` `the day of the last posting` MEANS
    `the day that is a number of days after a date` 120 `the day of the last posting`

-- src:140 | the text of each qualifying non-binding instrument that became operative during the preceding 120 days, and the information described in subparagraphs (A)(iii) and (B)(iii) of subsection (a)(1) relating to each such instrument, available to the public on the website of the Department of State.
@ref 1 U.S.C. s 112b(b)(2) (src:140)
GIVEN `the day the instrument became operative` IS A DATE
      `the day of the posting` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 112b(b)(2) covers the instrument in the posting` `the day the instrument became operative` `the day of the posting` MEANS
    `a date falls in the preceding number of days` `the day the instrument became operative` `the day of the posting` 120

