GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 112b(f) requires the substance of the agreement to be reduced to writing for the purpose of subsections (a) and (b)` `it is an oral international agreement` MEANS
    `it is an oral international agreement`

-- src:160 | (g) Notwithstanding any other provision of law, an international agreement may not be signed or otherwise concluded on behalf of the United States without prior consultation with the Secretary. Such consultation may encompass a class of agreements rather than a particular agreement.
@ref 1 U.S.C. s 112b(g) (src:160)
